Package: writing-environment-shell
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Writing Environment contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/moonknight82/writing-environment
Priority: optional
Section: utils
Depends: writing-environment (>= @APP_VERSION@), bash, bluez, blueman, ca-certificates, curl, file, fonts-liberation2, fonts-nunito-sans, fuzzel, libayatana-appindicator3-1, librsvg2-2, locales, network-manager, pcmanfm, pi-bluetooth, plymouth, procps, raindrop, raspi-utils, rasputin, rc-gui, rpd-wayland-core, rpcc, surf, util-linux, wlopm, wlr-randr, xdg-utils
Description: Minimal Raspberry Pi shell for Writing Environment
 Installs the Labwc session helpers, Fuzzel system drawer, Raspberry Pi
 settings integration, keyboard defaults, browser launcher, and appliance
 desktop defaults used by Writing Environment.
